<title>FINLAND: SISU JAN-AUG PROFIT FIM 15 MLN VS 131 MLN.</title>
<headline>SISU JAN-AUG PROFIT FIM 15 MLN VS 131 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			    15 vs 131</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,529 vs 3,679</p>
<p> Operating profit				   105 vs 233</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 10 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	   15 vs 121</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    25.6 vs 23.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned heavy vehicle maker</p>
<p>is Oy Sisu Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
